# word timer_status.dialog already speaks, {name} timern har {remaining} kvar.
# 'vänster' below is the DIRECTION left and does not belong here. It is kept
# so no phrasing is lost until a speaker removes it. Both lines unvouched.
kvar
klar
lång
redo
slut
status
vänster
ändar
